-- Highwire Farms - Adrian MED - (UBI: HIGHWIRE FARMS LLC)
our patients with the best medicine available and developing premium 
products designed to deliver a life of good times, anytime, anywhere.<br></p><p>In 2015 two friends, Tony and Eric started a company called Urban Farms in a storage 
room located in Eric’s warehouse – they built racks, bought grow lights,
 ran water lines and purchased their first batch of seeds – without 
really knowing much about the business of indoor farming. But, they were
 eager to learn and determined to provide fresh heads of lettuce, basil,
 herbs and micro-greens to the Indianapolis community.</p>
<p>They loved the idea of local fresh produce being available all year 
long and hustled their fresh greens to local restaurants and nearby 
Farmer’s Markets.</p>
<p>They didn’t make a lot of money and killed many plants testing 
multiple cutting-edge growing techniques, but quickly learned from their
 mistakes and gained an appreciation for indoor cultivation and fresh 
farm-to-table products.</p>
<p>At first, growing marijuana wasn’t on the radar, but then they were 
introduced to the many health benefits of medical marijuana, and 
cultivation of cannabis seemed like a natural fit. So the boys bought an
 old farm in Michigan, became legal caregivers, dug a well, put air 
conditioning and grow lights up in the barn and started utilizing their 
new skills.</p>', 'field', 'Relationship', 'salesforce import') ON CONFLICT(state, customer, label) DO UPDATE SET value = excluded.value, section = excluded.section;

